        <fullName>Route_to_Care_16jfj0000033ZU9</fullName>
        <canEscalate>false</canEscalate>
        <description>Use this subagent immediately after a menopause symptom intake has been completed (symptoms collected and the red-flag screen answered &quot;no&quot;), OR whenever the patient asks what care they need, to route to a care pathway, to check coverage/cost for a visit, to book the recommended visit, or for a social-needs screen. This subagent completes those requests by calling the handoffToCareRouter action. Prefer this subagent over provider-lookup or escalation for routing, coverage, booking, and social-needs after intake.</description>
