        <fullName>Find_a_Provider_16jfj0000033ZU9</fullName>
        <canEscalate>false</canEscalate>
        <description>The patient wants to SEARCH FOR or LOOK UP a specific menopause specialist, MSCP-credentialed clinician, OB/GYN, or endocrinologist by name, specialty, or location — e.g. &quot;find a provider near me&quot;, &quot;who are the menopause specialists near &lt;ZIP&gt;&quot;, &quot;give me a list of doctors&quot;. Do NOT use this subagent to decide what care a patient needs, to route to a care pathway, to book or schedule an appointment, or to check insurance coverage — those follow-ups belong to the Menopause Symptom Intake subagent and its handoffToCareRouter action. Use this only for an explicit provider directory lookup.</description>
